## Surviving-line ownership, `cJSON.c` + `cJSON.h`

This is `git blame -w -M -C` at HEAD, 3,601 lines in total, 46 distinct authors.

| # | Author | Lines | Share |
|---|--------|------:|------:|
| 1 | Max Bruckner | 2,699 | **75.0%** |
| 2 | Kevin Branigan | 149 | 4.1% |
